{"id": "69396", "title": "婚婚闹离婚", "author": "温韭", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 25, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69396.htm", "intro": "<font size=4>婚了太久，生活就没了新鲜感、刺激感，继而开始闹离婚。\n    婚了九年后，伊玲突然没有任何预兆的给纪文递过来一张离婚协议书。\n    纪文漫不经心的扫了一遍，头也不抬的问：“什么意思？你有外遇了，还是对我厌倦了？”\n    伊玲淡道：“厌倦这个婚姻了。”\n    成功离婚不久后，伊玲正在商场看首饰，纪文理直气壮的走过去，跪下。\n    伊玲皱眉问：“你干嘛？”\n    “求婚。”厌倦婚姻么，我就重新赠予你激情。\n    </font>", "base": "files/article/html/69/69396", "chapters": [{"title": "章节目录", "volume": true}, {"title": "001章 冬天", "file": "10620174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002章 暗恋", "file": "10620175.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003章 纪念", "file": "10620176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004章 纪文", "file": "10620177.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005章 二弟", "file": "10620178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006章 职业", "file": "10620179.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007章 出狱", "file": "10620180.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008章 梁子", "file": "10620181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009章 侨朗", "file": "10620182.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010章 工作", "file": "10620183.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011章 过渡", "file": "10620184.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012章 生日", "file": "10620185.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013章 礼貌", "file": "10620186.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014章 混乱", "file": "10620187.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015章 校园", "file": "10620188.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10620189.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10620190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10620191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10620192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10620193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10641953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10641954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": 